Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository bundles no third-party source code. Every file under src/,
tests/, scripts/ and website/ is original work by the copyright holder above.
There are no vendored libraries, no minified bundles, no web fonts and no CDN
assets; the web app loads only files it ships itself.

Hermit CRM does depend, at run time, on packages that are installed separately
from PyPI and are not part of this distribution. They are listed in
pyproject.toml and remain under their own licences:

  fastapi             MIT
  uvicorn             BSD-3-Clause
  jinja2              BSD-3-Clause
  python-multipart    Apache-2.0
  python-frontmatter  MIT
  pyyaml              MIT

Installing Hermit CRM also pulls in the transitive dependencies of those
packages (starlette, pydantic and others), likewise under their own licences.
Run `pip show <package>` or read the package's own LICENSE file for the text.

